hire_description:
We need specialist competition and corporate counsel to help a group of shipping industry leaders launch a not-for-profit, blockchain-enabled trade data platform. The work must:
- advise on a JV/consortium structure that minimizes required regulatory clearances;
- conduct competition law analysis and prepare antitrust filings with local counsel;
- coordinate approvals in multiple jurisdictions, including Australia, China, Hong Kong SAR, Chile, Poland, South Korea and Ukraine.
